CloudBurrow patch 3 of 3 to the Cloud Spanner emulator v1.5.58
(GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator, commit
a081a7e71aba5f4d05fc8c6b21ef1a269dcbac28, Apache-2.0).

Upstream file: backend/query/query_engine_test.cc.

Why (cloudburrow/cloudburrow#2029): regression tests for the patches above,
on the emulator's own test graph (nodes 1, 2, 4; edges 1->2, 2->4, 4->1,
1->4): a GQL RETURN ... ORDER BY (ascending, descending, two keys) comes back
in order, not with its first two rows swapped; PROPERTY_EXISTS on a node and
an edge; COUNT of a group variable; ANY CHEAPEST with an edge COST.

